# The reference had planned the first check of these for after the end of
# the run: the next check in the state it saved.
first b@15200 the reference had planned its first check for after the end of the run
first a-z@23200 the reference had planned its first check for after the end of the run
first c-q@23200 the reference had planned its first check for after the end of the run

# The members of a group. The reference gives the hosts of a host group by
# name, the services of a service group in the reverse of the order it
# added them in, and the contacts of a contact group in an order of its
# own with the first one twice. checkd gives all three by name, each
# member once.
mask sgrp s1,s3,c1,c2,c3,c4,c5,sn the order of the members of a service group or a contact group
mask hgrp s1,s3,c1,c2,c3,c4,c5,sn the order of the members of a service group or a contact group

# The groups an object is in, and so which one is its first. The reference
# has them in the reverse of the order it added them in, checkd by name.
mask sgrp own,ownn,owns,ownsn the order of the groups an object is in
